                        "review": "people hate this game series just for the sake of hating it. it might not be a god-level visual novel compared to some of the others out there, but it has cool characters, interesting concepts, and the gameplay is actually pretty fun. is the writing sometimes questionable? absolutely, that wont change\r\n\r\noverall, its a fun murder mystery vn with a ridiculous cast, some good moments, and some cool characters. would recommend if you like mystery games, visual novels, or watching fictional teenagers suffer for 20+ hours",
